      "note": "Modern functional substitution: 9.5 mm, lambda 0.25, 21.6 kg over 3 m2. Gypsum heat capacity remains a declared independent family assumption; not original windboard evidence."
    },
    "gypsum_era": {
      "url": "https://www.gyproc.se/blogg/fran-1950-talet-till-dagens-moderna-gipsteknik-gyprocs-roll-i-svensk-bygghistoria",
      "note": "Gypsum-board production in Sweden began in 1957. General era plausibility only; modern GU9 wind sheathing is a functional representative substitution, not established as original SE.02 product."
    },
    "rubber_finish": {
      "url": "https://www.nora.com/-/media/files/worldwide/technical-files/technical-datasheets-floorings/english-per-product/tds_noraplan_convia_2mm_en_01-2025.pdf",
